# --- media
# The assets are IN the repository, not dropped in later: the three empty-state
# illustrations are hand-authored source, and the other thirteen are built by
# `frontend/scripts/make-media.mjs` from the real product and committed, so a clone
# builds a complete site and backend/tests/test_media_assets.py can check them against
# the manifest. 1.7 MB in total.
#
# The MapLibre worker is the exception: a build artefact of a pinned dependency, copied
# into public/ by `npm run prebuild`. Committing it would be a version skew waiting to
# happen.
frontend/public/maplibre-gl-worker.mjs

# --- os
.DS_Store
